  "reason": "Existing evidence shows scvi_n200 and imagenet_vit_l RNA/image encoders with transformer aggregation and weighted fusion achieve high performance. This experiment tests the impact of switching to resnet50 image encoder and singleprofile setting while keeping scvi_n200 and weighted fusion, isolating the effect of image encoder and profile setting changes. It balances exploration of key design choices with minimal prior evidence on their impact."
}

